+# Patch 0059: Training mode foundations (B6a)
+
+Everything the course format needs, plus one small course ("How training works", `welcome`) that uses every stage, so the engine can be tried on the iPad before real courses arrive in 0060.
+
+## What it does
+- **Practice data** (`trainingSandbox`, `trainingSession`): on Start, pending saves are written, the real state is kept in memory, and a practice store (6 items, 2 collections, 3 customers, an open shift, a stocked drawer) is swapped in. On exit the real state is put back. Disk is never written during training, so a crash just reopens the normal till.
+- **Guards** (`trainingGuard`): storage (`kv`), Shopify (`hasCreds`, `gql`, `getToken`, login and secret setters), the history CSVs, receipt upload, badge storage, the card reader (a practice terminal replaces it, `checkReader` short-circuits) and the 25 second sync tick all stop while training.
+- **Spots**: `spot` prop on Btn, Chip, Row, IconBtn; tiles, cart lines, tabs, More row, cart bar carry ids.
+- **Overlay and dock**: spotlight with a bubble and arrow (taps pass through the hole), a bottom dock (Hint, Skip, Exit) that shrinks the app, and the same overlay inside every Sheet via a layer registry (a native Modal covers anything else).
+- **Hints**: ladder per goal, last rung rings the answer, a nudge after 40 seconds idle.
+- **Stages**: Info slideshow, Show autoplay, practice-data card, Guide, Check 1, Check 2, Done (confetti, green tick, recap). Stages go in order inside a module, modules are never locked. Progress is per staff member on this device.
+
+## Bends from DEV_NOTES line 43 (also in PROGRESS.md)
+See B6 in PROGRESS.md.
